The passages, lines, stops and traffic messages come from the open data of
Ilévia, the bus, metro and tram network of the Métropole Européenne de Lille
(MEL), published by the MEL on https://data.lillemetropole.fr under the
Licence Ouverte / Open Licence 2.0 (Etalab):
https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/licence-ouverte-open-licence/. Source: MEL – Ilévia.
The widgets show the source (Ilévia) and the time of each reading. The files
under test/fixtures are extracts of these data, kept under the same licence.

